utiful technique getting a  perfect score of 300 is pretty much  unheard of we all know that Maddie has  won first place and been giving a  perfect score in the past and now lily  is matching her step by step it's rare  to see Abby's smiling and giving  compliments at the same time but in  season 8 episode 9 Abby congratulated  Lily on a job well done while giving the  other dancers constructive feedback this  reminded us of all the times Abby gave  Maddie praise in front of everyone else  only to tear down the rest of her  dancers each one of you are just another  number it's easy to see that Maddie and  Lily are two very different dancers but  they both share a special characteristic  that makes them stand out from the crowd  when it comes to these two dancers it  isn't about making a show or hitting it  hard instead it's all about emotion and  grace there's a reason why Abby assigns  dark and emotional solos to Lily and  it's because she always has what it  takes to execute them Abby gives Lily  the same kind of solos she used to give  Maddie and Lily knocks him out of the  park every single time but that wasn't  always the case at the beginning of  season eight Lily was making mistake  after mistake and she felt terrible  after one particularly bad performance  Lily tearfully told Abby  but Abby wasn't buying it she took her  out to a restaurant for some one-on-one  time and helped boost Lily's morale  Abby usually brings the entire group out  for lunch or no one at all it's very  rare that she only brings one student  out but she did this for Lily and she's  done it for Maddie in the past  clearly Abby sees something special in  Lily and she wants to nurture it when  you toast you have to look the person in  the eye but Abby needs to be careful  because she might be just repeating past  mistakes and that bears repeating  lily and Maddie might have a lot in  common but they have their differences  too Lily is much more flexible than  Maddie  whereas Maddie's musicality is far  greater than Lily's but even then it  looks like Abby is trying to get Lily to  fill Maddie's shoes she's pushing her to  become the next big thing we just hope  that Abby remembers that Maddie and Lily  are two very different people  Abby's former dancer Jojo see were  returned to the ALDC in season 8 episode  9 Lily was given the solo straight  escape which was a lot like JoJo's solo  straighten up from season 5 Lily  received a perfect score for her  performance but while she was supposed  to draw inspiration from JoJo's number  it would appear that she mimicked  Maddie's style Lily's facial expressions  were very similar to Maddie's in the  Lizzie Borden dance from season 6 you  can clearly see the similarities between  these two stars when you watch them  dancing side-by-side it's super obvious  that Abby Lee Miller sees something  special in Liliana catchman she's  constantly pushing her to do better and  giving her challenging solos that show  off her innate skill set some of the  other dancers are a little jealous and  it's starting to show Abby has an  affinity for Lily but she doesn't have  for the other dancers she believes Lily  to be a star and wants to help her reach  for them what do you guys think is Lily  the new Maddie or do we have it all  wrong  sound off in the comments  give this video a big thumbs up if you  love Dance Moms and subscribe to the  thing so you never miss another video  thanks for watching we'll see you later  [Music]
 

